CHAPTER.VERS:
And when he had left speaking, he said to Simon, Put out into the deep, and let down your

          {+}
         nets for a catch.

But Jesus perceiving their reasonings, answered and said to them, Why do you

          {+}
         reason in your

          {+}
         hearts?

But that you

          {+}
         may know that the Son of Man has authority on earth to forgive sins--he said to him who was palsied: I say to you, Arise, and take up your couch, and go to your house.

And the Pharisees and their scribes murmured against his disciples, saying, Why do you

          {+}
         eat and drink with the publicans and sinners?

And Jesus said to them, Can you

          {+}
         make the sons of the bride-chamber fast, while the bridegroom is with them?
